      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yothamu yafuuka kyabazinga ng'agheza emyaka amakumi abiri n'etaanu egy'obukulu, era yaafugira entangama ya myaka ikumi na mukaaga mu Yerusalemu. Inhina yali nga ni Yerusha mughala wa Zadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yothamu yaakolanga ebituufu Musengwa Katonda by'asiima, nga lata we Uzzia bye yakolanga. Aye tiyaghaguza kwingira mu isinzizo kuniokeza bubbaani, ng'oti ni ise bwe yakola waire ng'abantu baaja mu maiso n'okukola ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazimba omulyango ogw'eitale ogw'eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, era yaakola inho ku kuzimba ekimante ekigumu eky'oku kibuga Yerusalemu, mu kitundu ekyetebwa Ofeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazimba ebibuga mu biketezo bya Buyudaaya eby'oku nsozi, era yaazimba ebifo eby'okwewogomamu n'ebituuti ebirengererwaku mu bibira eby'oku nsozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaalwanisa kyabazinga w'Abammoni yaamughangula. Abammoni abo baamugha omusolo mu mwaka ogwo, nga gwa talanta kikumi (100) edha feeza, n'ensawo omutwalo mulala (10,000) edh'engaano, n'ensawo omutwalo mulala (10,000) edhindi edha sayiri. Era baamugha omusolo ogwaga n'ogwo, mu mwaka ogwokubiri ni mu gwokusatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Yothamu yaafuuka wa maani, kuba yagonderanga Musengwa Katonda we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
